==Trivia==
*On the in-game map, this stage resembles the head of [[wikia:dragonball:Vegeta|Vegeta]], a character from ''Dragon Ball Z''.
**This theory is further supported by the [[Treasure]] being a forehead, a prominent feature of Vegeta's.
**This may be why the enemy base is made out of <u>vegeta</u>bles. Alternatively, this could be a broader reference to the fact that in Dragon Ball [[wikia:dragonball:Origins of character names#Saiyans|Saiyan are named after vegetables]].
**"Sighter" could be another term for a [[wikia:dragonball:Scouter|Scouter]].
**The stage's Japanese name "Saīta Star" (サイータ星), may also simply be a portmanteau of the words "<u>Sai</u>yan" and "Vege<u>ta</u>".

